  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "Today we learn about water in our science class. There is a bottle of clear water on the table. I use a ruler to measure how tall it is. My friend puts blue water in a small cup. We mix it with yellow water and watch the color change. A glass beside us is full, but another is empty. I am careful when I move the full glass. Only a drop of water falls on the table. We clean our place and tell the teacher what we see.",
    "textZh": "今天我們在科學課學習水的知識。桌上有一瓶清澈的水。我用尺測量瓶子有多高。朋友把藍色的水放進一個小杯子。我們把它和黃色的水混合，看著顏色改變。我們旁邊一個玻璃杯是滿的，另一個則是空的。移動裝滿的玻璃杯時，我很小心。只有一滴水落在桌上。我們清理座位，把看到的結果告訴老師。",
